    "PayrollWidgetSummaryQuery": {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"asOf":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Instant"},"fields":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Fields"},"freshness":{"type":"string","enum":["FRESH_ONLY","ALLOW_STALE"]}},"required":["asOf","fields","freshness"]},
    "FoundationQuery": {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"asOf":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Instant"},"fields":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Fields"},"freshness":{"type":"string","enum":["FRESH_ONLY","ALLOW_STALE"]}},"required":["asOf","fields","freshness"]},
